## Nextflow Pipeline

The generated project includes a Nextflow DSL2 scaffold with local modules and profile-based execution.

```bash
# Check local Nextflow/Java prerequisites
make nextflow-prereqs

# Validate selected profile
nextflow config -profile {{ nextflow_default_profile }}

# Run smoke test profile
nextflow run main.nf -profile test,{{ nextflow_default_profile }} --input "data/test/samplesheet.csv" --outdir results-test
```

- The generated scaffold targets Nextflow 25 and supports `apptainer` profile usage.
{%- if include_aws_batch %}
- `awsbatch` profile is generated with AWS region, Batch queue, S3 work directory, and private ECR container defaults.
- Use `nextflow run main.nf -profile awsbatch` to execute on AWS Batch.
{%- else %}
- Enable `include_aws_batch` to generate a concrete AWS Batch profile and private ECR defaults.
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}

